cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the study associated with the result or artifact you use. The references
  below identify the companion research outputs.
title: Gauge Floors Reproducibility and Tutorials
type: software
date-released: 2026-08-20
repository-code: https://github.com/piyush314/gauge-floors
abstract: >-
  Numerical experiments, executable tutorials, notebooks, generated figures,
  and provenance records for studies of independent-noise gauge floors and
  product-aware deterministic matrix rounding. Manuscript source is maintained
  separately and is not part of this repository.
keywords:
  - matrix quantization
  - matrix products
  - discrepancy theory
  - nuclear norm
  - reproducible research
